Package: qualcomm-iqfiles-qcs9075
Architecture: all
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: qcom-chicdk-qcs9100,
         ${misc:Depends},
Description: tuned Qualcomm QCS9075 camera IQ files
 This package provides tuned Qualcomm camera IQ data for the QCS9075
 IMX577 camera. The tuned file is activated through a reversible dpkg
 diversion so the vendor camera package remains upgradeable.
